FIDELITY: STRICT. Change nothing except image quality: remove noise and blur and recover fine detail while every shape, colour and element stays exactly where it is.

Avoid: visible seams, vignette, uneven lighting, perspective distortion.

Technical: clean edges with no halos or ringing, no over-sharpening, no banding, no repeating or tiled texture patterns, no compression artifacts. Output a single high-resolution image of the same aspect ratio (2048 px or more on the long side), with no text, border, collage, watermark or before/after.

If rules conflict, priority is: 1) exact geometry, 2) fidelity to the attached image and the guide above, 3) natural, believable detail."
